{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15219190","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15219190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1521919001:1":{"text":"トータス町の中で、この広場がいちばん好きな場所なんです……","source_cn":"整个图塔镇，我最喜欢的就是这个广场……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4CE399B715A25AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521919002:1":{"text":"種まきの頃は、友達とここで日向ぼっこをしながら、いろんな話をしました……夏の涼しい夜には、歌ったり踊ったりしたものです……","source_cn":"播种的季节，我和朋友会在这里晒着太阳，聊聊天……天气热...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21F96911BDAA18ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521919003:1":{"text":"収穫が終わると、広場いっぱいに麦が干されて、黄金色に輝いていました。周辺の町からは麦を求めて、荷馬車が次々とやって来たのです……","source_cn":"丰收以后，广场就晒满了麦子，金灿灿的。周围的城镇都来我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A8DCCFD75BBD81C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521919004:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">エリオ</style>と出会ったのもここだったなぁ……そして私たちは恋に落ちて、やがて家族になった……","source_cn":"我也是在这里认识的<style=highlight>埃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x342F431250880E70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:5:1521919005:0":{"text":"ナルシーは、過去の記憶を語り始めた……","source_cn":"南茜讲述起她的回忆……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF43B825927DD273A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521919006:1":{"text":"ナルシー！今日の体調はどう？どこも具合は悪くない？","source_cn":"南茜！今天感觉怎么样，身体有没有什么不舒服的地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5318A1B4E32BFAE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521919007:1":{"text":"ほんと心配性なんだから……私なら広場で日向ぼっこする時間もあるし、むしろ心配なのはあなたよ。毎日ずっと働いて……ほら、顔が汗びっしょり……あまり無理はしないでよ。","source_cn":"你真是个操心的爸爸……我每天就在广场上晒晒太阳，能有什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF84604CE01EAAC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521919008:1":{"text":"麦はもう全部刈っちゃったんでしょ？疲れてない？","source_cn":"瞧瞧你，脸上都是汗……麦子都割完了吧，累不累？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC17C25469DBE04C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521919009:1":{"text":"これくらい何でもないよ！少しでも多く収穫すれば、僕たちの子どもに服やおもちゃをたくさん買ってやれるしね！","source_cn":"这有什么！一想到只要多收几捧麦子，就能给咱们的孩子多买...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63A248149142B068","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521919010:1":{"text":"あなたみたいな素敵なパパを持って、マルコスもルイアも幸せね。","source_cn":"有你这么好的爸爸，马可或者瑞娅一定会很开心的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27E3ECEDE214CE9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521919011:1":{"text":"マルコス？ルイア？もしかして、もう名前を考えてるの？","source_cn":"马可？瑞娅？这是你给孩子起的名字吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62C5BC9C636CA0A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521919012:0":{"text":"ええ。男の子ならマルコス、女の子ならルイアよ。","source_cn":"是啊。如果是男孩就叫马可，如果是女孩，就叫瑞娅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5621EA6F66469F41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521919013:1":{"text":"昔この町に二人のとても敬虔な司祭がいてね、その名前がマルコスとルイアっていうの。彼らにあやかって、豊穣神様の庇護が受けられるといいなって。","source_cn":"咱们镇上以前有两位很虔诚的祭司，他们就叫这两个名字。我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB77FFC29F2877EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521919014:0":{"text":"心配しなくても大丈夫さ！なんせここは、<style=\"highlight\">豊穣神様に守られているトータス町</style>なんだから！","source_cn":"放心吧，一定会的！这里可是<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCE3D3A56E9D0D44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521919015:0":{"text":"こんな日々が……永遠に続くものだと思っていました……","source_cn":"我以为……我以为那样的日子会永远持续下去……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4877633C7BAF577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_rec